  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When on desktop, it is no longer possible to toggle AFK, while the quick menu or the main menu is open.\n\nThis was possible a couple months ago, but not is not possible anymore. I think it broke around the time the new main menu was implemented.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n * Press END to toggle AFK on, you change to the AFK state as expected\n * Press END again to toggle AFK off, you change out of the AFK state as expected\n * Press ESC to open the quick menu\n * Press END to toggle AFK on, nothing happens",
